  "content": "<p data-pid=\"VU4R2iis\">关于局部最优/贪心性/风险厌恶/创造性破坏（例如波特假说或股权溢价之谜）的一些有趣链接；相关现象有时会在灾难中显现出来。</p><blockquote data-pid=\"YAIX6biO\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-5.6-sol，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>首次发表于 2021-03-24。状态：已完成；置信度说明：log；重要性：5/10。<br/>原文：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/note/local-optima\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Local Optima &amp; Greedy Choices · Gwern.net</a></blockquote><ul><li data-pid=\"iAVCxSW5\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/automation/index\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《自动化犹如殖民浪潮》</a></li><li data-pid=\"kXflpA0g\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.oreilly.com/content/piracy-is-progressive-taxation-and-other-thoughts-on-the-evolution-of-online-distribution/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《默默无闻对作者和艺术创作者的威胁远甚于盗版》</a>，Timothy O&#39;Reilly 2002</li><li data-pid=\"bIgNvXbK\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.amazon.com/Luck-Factor-Scientific-Wiseman-Paperback/dp/B00IGYST8M/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《幸运因素》</a>，Wiseman 2004</li><li data-pid=\"550w8iAT\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/psychology/okcupid/themathematicsofbeauty.html\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《OKCupid：美貌的数学》</a>，Rudder 2011</li><li data-pid=\"PwKB5rGW\"><b>战争/灾难/崩溃</b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"Z7YpP-yF\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/1995-bendavid.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《大战、大崩盘与稳态增长：关于一个旧有典型事实的一些新证据》</a>，Ben-David &amp; Papell 1995；<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2002-skidmore.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《自然灾害会促进长期增长吗？》</a>，Skidmore &amp; Toya 2002</li><li data-pid=\"exX8iieg\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2018-deryugina.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《卡特里娜飓风对受灾者的经济影响：来自个人纳税申报表的证据》</a>，Deryugina et al 2014</li><li data-pid=\"lcPeH_cc\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2018-aiyar.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《因 Sardar Sarovar 大坝项目被迫搬迁并重新安置的人，如今是否比没有搬迁的昔日邻居过得更好？》</a>，Aiyar &amp; Kaushal 2018</li><li data-pid=\"a5B7YMA7\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//eprints.lse.ac.uk/63832/1/dp1372.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《被迫尝试的益处：来自伦敦地铁网络的有力证据》</a>，Larcom et al 2017</li><li data-pid=\"xM8jpkmV\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2016-michaels.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《重置城市网络：117--2012 AD》</a>，Michaels &amp; Rauch 2016；<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/perpetuities/2021-heldring.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《修士、绅士与实业家：英国修道院解散的长期影响》</a>，Heldring et al 2021（参见有关<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/perpetuities/index\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">永久存续安排</a>/<i><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/narrowing-circle%23ancestors\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">waqfs</a></i> 会把错误固化下来的批评）</li><li data-pid=\"yFDz6gcN\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm%3Fabstract_id%3D3819317\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《Lehman 的「柠檬」：职业中断会影响顶尖的 5% 人群吗？》</a>，Fedyk &amp; Hodson 2021</li><li data-pid=\"vlJUZx9H\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2021-arellanobover.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《流离失所、多样性与流动性：日裔美国人拘禁的职业影响》</a>，Arellano-Bover 2021</li><li data-pid=\"9HXl8RK6\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/automation/2024-barros.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《自然灾害与金融科技的采用》</a>，Barros et al 2024</li><li data-pid=\"51cVr-5O\">火灾（<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//academic.oup.com/past/article/265/1/97/7625037\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">背景</a>）：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"tP7SGWTA\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/download%3Fdoi%3D10.1.1.248.7497%26rep%3Drep1%26type%3Dpdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《夷平旧金山：将 1906 年灾难作为城市再开发的自然实验》</a>，Siodla 2012；<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/georgism/2021-pennington.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《新建住房会导致人口迁离吗？——旧金山住房建设的供给与需求效应》</a>，Pennington 2021</li><li data-pid=\"0zJ2t4aW\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2017-hornbeck.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《创造性破坏：城市增长的障碍与 1872 年波士顿大火》</a>，Hornbeck &amp; Keniston 2017（可与<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.amazon.com/Limits-Power-Process-Christine-1986-04-30/dp/B01F9GNNFI/\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《权力的限度：大火与美国城市增长进程》</a>（Rosen 1986）相比较）</li><li data-pid=\"CO8XE88R\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//eprints.lse.ac.uk/88694/1/dp1542.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《十亿英镑的损失：伦敦大轰炸与集聚经济学》</a>，Dericks &amp; Koster 2018（与 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2020-lin-2.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Lin 2020</a> 形成对照）</li><li data-pid=\"sHJZbnS1\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/georgism/2022-liao.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《野火对加利福尼亚市政当局的财政影响》</a>，Liao &amp; Kousky 2022</li></ul></ul><li data-pid=\"OIyJy-sr\"><b>决策</b>：</li><ul><li data-pid=\"38--aO2w\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//docs.iza.org/dp11308.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《做出重大决定：迁居对美国陆军人员婚姻的影响》</a>，Carter &amp; Wozniak 2018</li><li data-pid=\"eEkL_s24\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=http%3A//www.econweb.umd.edu/~pope/westpointtiming.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《时机决定一切：来自大学专业选择的证据》</a>，Patterson et al 2019</li><li data-pid=\"CcPCk1aA\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/psychology/cognitive-bias/2020-levitt.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《正面还是反面：抛硬币对重大人生决定及后续幸福感的影响》</a>，Levitt 2020</li><li data-pid=\"05mWsygu\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//doughanley.com/files/papers/thompson_hanley_wikipedia.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《科学由 Wikipedia 塑造：来自随机对照试验的证据》</a>，Thompson et al 2017；<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.marit.hinnosaar.net/wikipediamatters.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《Wikipedia 很重要》</a>，Hinnosaar et al 2019</li><li data-pid=\"1VjkEuG2\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/economics/2022-nakamura.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《搬迁的馈赠：流动性冲击的代际后果》</a>，Nakamura et al 2022</li></ul><li data-pid=\"rp6TC6DQ\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/creative_destruction\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">创造性破坏</a>；「<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Porter_hypothesis\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">波特假说</a>」；<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/equity_premium_puzzle\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">股权溢价之谜</a></li><li data-pid=\"qBjZVeHF\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.law.nyu.edu/sites/default/files/upload_documents/Property%2520Monopoly.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《财产是垄断的别称：以频谱、公司与土地的部分共同所有权促进高效议价》</a>，Posner &amp; Weyl 2016</li><li data-pid=\"lNbIkA87\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/492058.full\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《现实环境中的探索》</a>，Schulz et al 2018（这篇论文颇有意思，但并未明确证实存在次优探索；它使用了一个极其庞大的数据集，其中收录了个人通过 <a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deliveroo\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Deliveroo</a> 下达的餐厅订单）</li><li data-pid=\"HoTjJqQJ\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//arxiv.org/abs/1609.03526\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《人类流动中存在守恒量的证据》</a>，Alessandretti et al 2016（人们只会造访少数实体地点；尽管他们确实会不断探索新地点 &amp; 变换活动地点，但似乎也存在一个类似<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dunbar%25E2%2580%2599s_number\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">邓巴数</a>的对应量，这提示，人类轻松规划/记住经常涉及超过 ~25 个地点的活动的能力可能存在局限）</li><li data-pid=\"47GHVtGo\">一个颇有意思的虚构例子或许是《小马宝莉》中的一集<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//mlp.fandom.com/wiki/Applejack%2527s_%2522Day%2522_Off\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《Applejack 的「休息日」》</a>。</li><li data-pid=\"RdQFFH2Q\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.npr.org/sections/alltechconsidered/2017/06/08/531796329/eager-to-burst-his-own-bubble-a-techie-made-apps-to-randomize-his-life\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《急于戳破自己的泡沫，一名科技从业者开发应用，让自己的生活随机起来》</a></li><li data-pid=\"MS4Yoxnk\"><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/doc/psychology/neuroscience/2021-camerer.pdf\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《神经自动驾驶与习惯的情境敏感性》</a>，Camerer &amp; Li 2021</li><li data-pid=\"etO9lq7P\"><b>另见</b>：<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/backstop\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《进化是强化学习的后盾》</a><sup data-text=\"演化：强化学习的最终保障\" data-url=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1944108824375060346\" data-draft-node=\"inline\" data-draft-type=\"reference\" data-numero=\"1\">[1]</sup>，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/sunk-cost\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《沉没成本》</a>，<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//gwern.net/socks\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">《论袜子多少才算够》</a></li></ul>",
